type: text
aliases: multiplayerconnectionfailed, connectionfailed, mcf
title: "Multiplayer Connection Failed"
color: failure

---

This error can occur due to various reasons. Please press the "Show details" button on the error screen: these will help us analyse the issue.

Additionally, Mojang also has [their own guide](https://help.minecraft.net/hc/en-us/articles/38555497091469-Named-Error-Code-Troubleshooting-for-Minecraft-Bedrock-Edition) on how to resolve common error codes.
